WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Process A writes it. Process B recovers the why.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Process A records the pool-limit decision with evidence.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Two real MCP processes. Same local store. No export. No import.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:39.300
Process B recovers why max_connections returned to 200.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:46.000
Two processes. One local memory.
